d levels are in metres{\fTimes New Roman|b0|i0|c238|p18; unless otherwise specified}.\P\pi-557.46981,l557.46981;5.^IThe tentative drawing for the work is based on Architectural drawing No. AR191/21(D) \P\pi0,l0;^IDt.01.11.2021.\P\pi-557.46981,l557.4698
