\A1;\P\P\P{\H0.9x;\P\fTimes New Roman|b0|i0|c238|p18;\LGENERAL NOTES:\fTimes New Roman|b0|i0|c0|p18;-\P\pt729.28557;\l1.^IGrade of Concrete - M30 design mix\P\A0;2.^IReinforcement grade: High strength deformed bar of minimum Grade Fe 500D\P\ptz;       
  3
  conforming to IS 1786 - 2008.\A1;\P\pt729.28557;\A0;3.^IClear cover to main Reinforcement \A1;\P\ptz;\P\P\P\P\P\P\pt729.28557;4.^I\fTimes New Roman|b0|i0|c238|p18;All dimensions are in m\fTimes New Roman|b0|i0|c0|p18;illimetres and levels are in metr
  3
es\fTimes New Roman|b0|i0|c238|p18; unless\fTimes New Roman|b0|i0|c0|p18; \fTimes New Roman|b0|i0|c238|p18;otherwise specified\fTimes New Roman|b0|i0|c0|p18;.\P5.^IThe tentative drawing for the work is based on Architectural drawing No.     \P\ptz;   
  3
      KKD-89/2023(D) rev d\fTimes New Roman|b0|i0|c238|p18;ated\fTimes New Roman|b0|i0|c0|p18; 01/02/2025 of the Senior architect, PWD North circle\P         Kozhikode.\A0;\P\pt729.28557;\A1;6.^IAll setting out dimensions and levels shall be as per Ar
  3
chitectural drawing. \P\fTimes New Roman|b0|i0|c238|p18;7.^IFor the detailed general notes and typical reinforcement details\fTimes New Roman|b0|i0|c0|p18; \fTimes New Roman|b0|i0|c238|p18;refer\fTimes New Roman|b0|i0|c0|p18; \fTimes New Roman|b0|i0|c
  3
238|p18;Drg.\fTimes New Roman|b0|i0|c0|p18; \fTimes New Roman|b0|i0|c238|p18;No.\fTimes New Roman|b0|i0|c0|p18; \P\ptz;         \fTimes New Roman|b0|i0|c238|p18;DRIQ/BL/\fTimes New Roman|b0|i0|c0|p18; \fTimes New Roman|b0|i0|c238|p18;/\fTimes New Rom
  3
an|b0|i0|c0|p18;2012 sheet No.1/3, 2/3 and 3/3.\P\pt729.28557;8.^IThe structure is designed for seismic zone III as per IS 1893 Part I-2016               \P\fTimes New Roman|b0|i0|c238|p18;9.^IWall loads are taken only for the beams wherever walls are 
  3
shown in the \fTimes New Roman|b0|i0|c0|p18;\P\ptz;         \fTimes New Roman|b0|i0|c238|p18;A\fTimes New Roman|b0|i0|c0|p18;r\fTimes New Roman|b0|i0|c238|p18;chitectural\fTimes New Roman|b0|i0|c0|p18; \fTimes New Roman|b0|i0|c238|p18;drawing.\fTimes
  3
 New Roman|b0|i0|c0|p18; \P\pt729.28557;\fTimes New Roman|b0|i0|c238|p18;10.^IDo not scale o\fTimes New Roman|b0|i0|c0|p18;f\fTimes New Roman|b0|i0|c238|p18;f the drawing, only figured dimensions shall be follo\fTimes New Roman|b0|i0|c0|p18;wed. \P\A0
  3
;11.^IMain slab projections, sunshades, vertical board works & lintels are to be provided as  \P\ptz;         per Architectural requirements.\P\pt729.28557;12.^IThe structure is designed for (G+2) floors only as per Architectural drawing. No  \P\ptz;  
  3
       future expansion for any upper floors is considered in the design.\P\pt729.28557;\H0.99683x;13.^IThe slope to drain off rain water from roof terrace and all other roofs shall be provided  \P\ptz;         in the slab/ beam form work itself, with
  3
out affecting the Architectural elevation  \P         requirements of the building.\P\pt729.28557;\H1.00318x;\C7;14.^ITermination of column shall be as per architectural drawing above general     \P\ptz;        roof UNO.\P\pt729.28557;\A1;\C256;15.^IIn
  1
 case of isolated footing the centre of the column shall coincide with the  \P\ptz;        centroid of the footing.}
