\A1;\pxsm1;\P\P\P\P\psm1.2;{\fTimes New Roman|b0|i0|c238|p18;\LGENERAL NOTES:\fTimes New Roman|b0|i0|c0|p18;-\P}\P\pi-2,l2,sm1,t2;1.^IGrade of Concrete - M30 design mix\P{\A0;2.^IReinforcement grade: High strength deformed bar of minimum Grade Fe 500D 
  1
confirming to IS \P\pi0,l0,tz;       1786 - 2008.}\P\pi-2,l2,t2;{\A0;3.^IClear cover to main Reinforcement }\P\pi0,l0,tz;\P\P\P\P\P\P\P\pt2;4.^I{\fTimes New Roman|b0|i0|c238|p18;All dimensions are in m}illimetres and levels are in metres{\fTimes New Ro
  1
man|b0|i0|c238|p18; unless otherwise specified}.\P\pi-2,l2;5.^IThe tentative drawing for the work is based on Architectural drawing No. AR191/21(D) \P\pi0,l0;^IDt.01.11.2021.\P\pi-2,l2;6.^IAll setting out dimensions and levels shall be as per Architectu
  1
ral drawing. \P{\fTimes New Roman|b0|i0|c238|p18;7.^IFor the detailed general notes and typical reinforcement details}  {\fTimes New Roman|b0|i0|c238|p18;refer } {\fTimes New Roman|b0|i0|c238|p18;Drg.No.DRIQ/BL/} {\fTimes New Roman|b0|i0|c238|p18;/}20
  1
12 \P\pi0,l0,t2,3;^Isheet No.1/3,2/3,3/3.\P\pi-2,l2,t2;8.^IThe structure is designed for seismic zone III as per IS 1893 Part I-2016               \P{\fTimes New Roman|b0|i0|c238|p18;9.^IWall loads are taken only for the beams wherever walls are shown i
  1
n the A}r{\fTimes New Roman|b0|i0|c238|p18;chitectural} {\fTimes New Roman|b0|i0|c238|p18;drawing.}\P{\fTimes New Roman|b0|i0|c238|p18;10.^IDo not scale of the drawing, only figured dimensions shall be follo}wed. \P{\A0;11.^IMain slab projections, suns
  1
hades, vertical board works, jally works & lintels are to be provided as per Architectural requirements.\P12.^IPoly carbonate sheet and supporting structures should be as per fabricator's details and shall be provided where ever specified in Architect
  1
ural drawing.\P13.^IThe structure is designed for (2B + G+3) floors to (G+3) floors only according to the Ground slope as per Architectural drawing. No future expansion for any upper floors is considered in the design.\P14.^IThe slope to drain off rain
  1
 water from roof terrace and all other roofs shall be provided in the slab/ beam form work itself, without affecting the Architectural elevation requirements of the building.}
